public int calculateIntersectionArea(Rect mainRect, List<Pair<Point, Point>> rectList)
```

Example:
```java
Rect mainRect = new Rect(0, 0, 10, 10);
List<Pair<Point, Point>> rectList = new ArrayList<>();
rectList.add(new Pair<>(new Point(5, 5), new Point(15, 15)));
